00:00:07.116 --> 00:00:08.268
(swooshing)

00:00:08.268 --> 00:00:09.378
(creaking sign)

00:00:09.388 --> 00:00:12.746
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:13.957
- I love Halloween.

00:00:13.957 --> 00:00:15.588
It's my favorite holiday.

00:00:15.588 --> 00:00:17.031
Aurora doesn't like Halloween.

00:00:17.031 --> 00:00:18.529
- I just, like, never had

00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:21.348
like the best Halloween experience.

00:00:21.348 --> 00:00:22.788
- I'm obsessed with Halloween.

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:25.146
- There's a stronger word than obsessed.

00:00:25.146 --> 00:00:26.723
We met at a Halloween party.

00:00:26.723 --> 00:00:28.232
Jen's, like, got a little
- [Jen] (laughs)

00:00:28.232 --> 00:00:29.371
- [Steven] stupid water gun

00:00:29.371 --> 00:00:30.869
and this giant grin on her face.

00:00:30.869 --> 00:00:31.914
I was, like, "Alright.

00:00:31.914 --> 00:00:32.922
"I kinda respect that."

00:00:32.922 --> 00:00:34.223
- So we've only had
one Halloween together.

00:00:34.223 --> 00:00:37.404
I was a diva, and I was Cruella de Vil,

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:40.364
and Tyler graciously was a dalmation.

00:00:40.364 --> 00:00:41.327
- [Tyler] I was a dalmation.

00:00:41.327 --> 00:00:42.345
She tells me what I'm gonna wear.

00:00:42.345 --> 00:00:44.992
She holds me to this standard of costume,

00:00:44.992 --> 00:00:46.094
and I deliver.

00:00:46.094 --> 00:00:49.641
(funky orchestral music)

00:00:49.641 --> 00:00:52.645
- I chose Khaleesi from Game of Thrones,

00:00:52.645 --> 00:00:54.445
so Daenerys Targaryen.

00:00:54.445 --> 00:00:58.207
Khaleesi is strong,
powerful, and assertive,

00:00:58.207 --> 00:00:59.868
which I think Safiya can identify with.

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:01.840
But she's also pretty high maintenance

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.105
and pretty queeny.

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:04.324
Safiya can be those things, too.

00:01:04.324 --> 00:01:07.499
- I chose a Cat Woman outfit for her

00:01:07.499 --> 00:01:09.299
because, you know, I'm a nerd.

00:01:09.299 --> 00:01:11.656
Cat Woman's always trying to be sensual,

00:01:11.656 --> 00:01:13.675
and Aurora's just more
down to earth and chill,

00:01:13.675 --> 00:01:15.462
so it'd be fun to see. (laughs)

00:01:15.462 --> 00:01:17.842
- I thought, like, immediately back to,

00:01:17.842 --> 00:01:19.862
which, maybe was my sexual awakening.

00:01:19.862 --> 00:01:24.591
In the movie Space Jam,
Lola Bunny was hot!

00:01:24.631 --> 00:01:26.151
Cute, but like, sassy.

00:01:26.165 --> 00:01:26.878
Had an attitude.

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.598
I think Jen has a lot of those qualities.

00:01:28.598 --> 00:01:32.764
(funky orchestral music)

00:01:32.764 --> 00:01:35.065
- I'm nervous because I
asked Steve for a clue

00:01:35.065 --> 00:01:37.493
and he said it's a character or person

00:01:37.493 --> 00:01:39.267
he had a crush on when he was younger.

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:40.266
He's told me stories about

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.925
