00:01:44.389 --> 00:01:46.273
I wouldn't normally dress up as.

00:01:46.273 --> 00:01:47.661
I would be up for dressing up as

00:01:47.661 --> 00:01:49.342
like an elf or a fairy.

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:52.801
- I think it's either like
a classic historical costume

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:55.542
or it's like, Dany,
like Daenerys Targaryen.

00:01:55.542 --> 00:01:59.674
(funky orchestral music)

00:01:59.674 --> 00:02:01.078
- Oh, my God, I think I was right.

00:02:01.078 --> 00:02:02.112
Is it Dany?

00:02:02.112 --> 00:02:03.058
Whenever Tyler wants to

00:02:03.058 --> 00:02:04.918
