00:02:21.262 --> 00:02:22.899
Oh, it's Cat Woman, huh?

00:02:22.899 --> 00:02:26.219
I'm so slow to these things.

00:02:26.219 --> 00:02:27.916
(drumming)

00:02:27.916 --> 00:02:29.728
- This feels pretty fun, actually.

00:02:29.728 --> 00:02:32.220
